WEBVTT

00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:21.895
<v><b>P:</b></v> Good afternoon.

00:00:22.344 --> 00:00:22.948
Can I help you?

00:00:23.219 --> 00:00:25.781
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I hurt my back.

00:00:26.979 --> 00:00:28.849
I need something for the pain.

00:00:28.932 --> 00:00:29.583
<v><b>P:</b></v> Of course.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:30.588
How did you hurt it?

00:00:31.974 --> 00:00:35.245
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, I was moving some heavy boxes this morning.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:40.714
<v><b>P:</b></v> OK, I see…Are you allergic to any medicines?

00:00:41.068 --> 00:00:41.782
<v><b>B:</b></v> No.

00:00:43.271 --> 00:00:45.136
<v><b>P:</b></v> Are you on any medication?

00:00:45.771 --> 00:00:46.740
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m not.

00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:49.011
<v><b>P:</b></v> No problem.

00:00:51.307 --> 00:00:52.682
This is ibuprofen.

00:00:52.838 --> 00:00:53.906
It will help with the pain.

00:00:54.943 --> 00:00:55.412
<v><b>B:</b></v> Great.

00:00:56.401 --> 00:00:57.818
How many do I have to take?

00:00:58.201 --> 00:01:00.495
<v><b>P:</b></v> Take two, every four to six hours,

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:03.781
and if it isn’t better in two or three days, go and see your doctor.

00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:06.010
<v><b>B:</b></v> OK, thanks.

00:01:06.891 --> 00:01:07.927
How much is that?

00:01:08.396 --> 00:01:09.708
<v><b>P:</b></v> Three ninety-nine, please.

00:01:14.948 --> 00:01:15.547
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:16.266
<v><b>P:</b></v> You’re welcome.